# Notícias Mobile (noticias-mobile)

API REST **noticias-mobile**: **Vapor 4 + Fluent + PostgreSQL** (Swift 6, SPM). Domínio: ML Terminal Snippets (projects, repositories, snippets, SSH).

## Estrutura

`Sources/noticias-mobile/{Commands,Controllers,DTOs,Infrastructure/Database/{Models,Repositories},Migrations,Application/Services}`

## Antes de codar

1. Ler `.cursor/skills/server-side-swift/ml-backoffice-patterns.md` (padrões Vapor; adaptar target `MlHub`)
2. Consultar ADRs em `docs/adr/` (001–007)
3. Novo recurso CRUD: Controller → Repository → DTO (ADR-003)
4. Migrations: schema API-owned → Fluent `AsyncMigration` em `Sources/MlHub/Migrations/` (ADR-002)

